This project builds on concepts and workflow structure from AgentSpec,
by Luan Moreno Maciel (https://github.com/luanmorenommaciel/agentspec),
licensed under the MIT License. The phase-based SDD flow (Brainstorm,
Define, Design, Build), the use of EARS-style acceptance tests, and the
Verify Gate concept are derived from that lineage, simplified and adapted
for beginner-friendly, agent-agnostic use.

SDD Starter is the beginner-oriented sibling of SpecGate
(https://github.com/robertodiasduarte/specgate), by the same author.
